{
 "about": "Values whose default reading no golden checked: jsonPath wildcards, index lists, slices and filters over an object, a scalar, or an element without the key, filter operators over values of another type, and letter case over characters whose upper case is two letters. Each comparison is `<comparison> OR resource.a == 'y'`, asked with resource.a 'n' and 'y': true, false, or the rule ended when both answer false.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R29G_",
